From 47a869ea40c3f930186ade2643e49d805022f533 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 01:30:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] FORK-10 (c): path-to and stop for mod entities, walking over
 the ground

mod-entity-update gains path-to (point and speed multiplier) and stop; the game walks the entity each tick at the kind's speed (x2.158 blocks a tick), over loaded blocks, climbing a block, dropping up to 3 and stopping at a wall or on arrival; a teleport clears the goal. Teleport was already in (a).

